⋯\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, for small $x,$ we have\n\n$$\n{(3+x)}^{5}≈243+405x+270{x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute $x=-0.08$ into the above approximation of $(3+x)^{5}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(2.92)^{5} & =(3+(-0.08))^{5} \\\\  & ≈243+405(-0.08)+270(-0.08)^{2} \\\\  & =243-405(0.08)+270(0.006\\,4) \\\\  & =243-32.4+1.728 \\\\  & =212.328\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using a calculator, we can compute the percentage error, as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}%\\,error & =\\frac{\\text{amount of error}}{\\text{exact value}}\\times 100 \\\\  & =\\frac{|(2.92)^{5}-212.328|}{(2.92)^{5}}\\times 100 \\\\  & ≈0.02%\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to two decimal places." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14060524/state.json" "file_sha256" "49caef80cec01ece4de45aa02bc0c2195026733ab72b69c196f06cc47649d776"} {"question" "q-134536" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14060524/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "657a1d0c9fc298b0bfd76bf9bfcf42171f33a0ba2583e289c6034e93f1c4b415"} {"question" "q-134536" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14060524/state.json" "file_sha256" "49caef80cec01ece4de45aa02bc0c2195026733ab72b69c196f06cc47649d776"} {"question" "q-134536" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "0.00%"] ["math" "0.01%"] ["math" "0.02%"] ["math" "0.04%"] ["math" "0.05%"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14060524/state.json" "file_sha256" "49caef80cec01ece4de45aa02bc0c2195026733ab72b69c196f06cc47649d776"} {"question" "q-134536" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "va